      transfer, gripper yaw flipped 180 deg'
    pushAngleDeg: -90
    pushLength: 0.1
    startBranchSeedDeg: []
    cartesianTransfer: 1
    matchedPairId: mp0
    branchLabel: wrist_down
    gripperYawFlip: 1
  - note: 'matched pair mp0: wrist-up branch, same TCP path as the wrist-down one,
